# UARoute

This app is a **Ukrainian-language catalog of passenger carriers** (Ukraine → Europe). Brand: **UAROUTE** / uaroute.com. Repo: `uaroots`.

## Do

- Keep user-visible strings in Ukrainian.
- Use existing Bulma classes (`button is-primary`, `hero is-primary`, `box`, `level`, `field`) before adding custom CSS.
- Put catalog data in `src/json/transporters.json` and page copy in `src/json/content.json`.
- Wire new global list/filter state through `TransporterContext` (`src/context/transporter.js`).
- After UI changes, verify in the browser (list, search, about, contact), not only by screenshot.

## Don't

- Don't introduce TypeScript, Redux, or a CSS framework other than Bulma unless asked.
- Don't point list rows at `/provider/:name` unless that page is actually implemented (it is a stub today).
- Don't add secrets to source. Ignore the Unsplash key in `src/api.js`; that helper is unused by the main app.

## Deploy

Production is a static CRA build on S3 (`make deploy` after `npm run build`). There is no app server.
